  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "特にそれらしい人はいないな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2017003010130,
    "speaker": "あさひ",
    "text": "そうっすね……うーん……残念っす",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charAnim4": "eye_right",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "asahi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201700301/2017003010130"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "（少し落ち込んでるみたいだな）",
    "textCtrl": "l",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "select": "どんな格好を\r\nしているんだ？",
    "nextLabel": "1"
  },
  {
    "select": "マジシャン\r\nじゃないけど",
    "nextLabel": "2"
  },
  {
    "textCtrl": "cm",
    "select": "事務所に\r\n戻ってみるか？",
    "nextLabel": "3"
  },
  {
    "id": 2017003010140,
    "label": "1",
    "speaker": "あさひ",
    "text": "シルクハットをかぶってるらしいっす",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charAnim4": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "asahi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201700301/2017003010140"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "なるほど……他にはないか？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2017003010150,
    "speaker": "あさひ",
    "text": "あと、青いスーツを着てるって聞いたっすね",
    "charAnim1": "shy1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "asahi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201700301/2017003010150"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "かなり目立ちそうだな……それならすぐに見つかりそうだ！",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "一旦さっきの通りまで戻ろう\r\n人の多いところにいそうだしな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2017003010160,
    "speaker": "あさひ",
    "text": "はいっす！\r\nふたりで探せば、きっと見つかるっすよね！",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "asahi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "nextLabel": "end",
    "voice": "produce_events/201700301/2017003010160"
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "off"
  },
  {
    "label": "2",
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "帰りに人だかりができてたのを見たぞ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2017003010170,
    "speaker": "あさひ",
    "text": "何かあったんすかね？",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_surp",
    "charAnim4": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "asahi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201700301/2017003010170"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "海外で大人気のお菓子らしいんだけど\r\n一号店が今日オープンしたらしい",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "あさひが探してるものじゃないが、行ってみるか？\r\n結構、美味しそうだったぞ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2017003010180,
    "speaker": "あさひ",
    "text": "それも面白そうっすね……",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "face_serious",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "asahi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201700301/2017003010180"
  },
  {
    "id": 2017003010190,
    "speaker": "あさひ",
    "text": "うーん……",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_serious_s",
    "charLabel": "asahi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201700301/2017003010190"
  },
  {
    "id": 2017003010200,
    "speaker": "あさひ",
    "text": "やっぱり、わたしはマジシャンを探すっす！",
    "charAnim1": "smile1",
    "charAnim2": "face_serious",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "asahi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201700301/2017003010200"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "お、おぉ……そうか",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2017003010210,
    "speaker": "あさひ",
    "text": "はいっす！　それじゃ、わたしは行くっすね！",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "asahi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
